# Values the user set for the sensors of the virtual backend. init reads this
# file once /data is mounted (post-fs-data), so early-boot creates the
# directory before the hal class starts. apexd only sets apex.<name>.ready on a
# rebootless update, never at boot. Without the directory the values are not
# kept across restarts of the HAL.
on early-boot
    mkdir /data/vendor/mainline_sensors 0770 system system
